Audio channelmap filter (src/audio/channelmap.ts)

src/audio/channelmap.ts adapts FFmpeg libavfilter/af_channelmap.c:
channelmap_init (parse-mode selection from the first character and the
character after the first '-', entry counting with a tolerated trailing '|',
get_channel_idx, get_channel, the output-layout derivation, the count and
duplicate-output checks), channelmap_config_input (input channel resolution)
and channelmap_filter_frame (plane reassignment). The native sample-format list
is ff_planar_sample_fmts() from channelmap_query_formats. The channel-name table
follows channel_names in libavutil/channel_layout.c.

Fixed FFmpeg commit:946fcce07b6dcd0331c8cc609192aeff5e1924f8
